{
    "_comment": "Dot the baker in the Village (next to the house). Says nothing concrete until the Hook quest; then reveals the minigame (memory). Who has the Hook is picked by the world seed.",
    "partner": "dot",
    "start": "talk",
    "nodes": {
        "talk": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "dot_01",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "If you're here to tell me my rolls are too small, I swear to the oven gods-"
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_02",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Morning! Or whatever it is. I've been up since four. Everything's a blur and it smells like cinnamon."
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_03",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "The kitchen was a total slaughterhouse this morning. Flour everywhere. Like a snowstorm in there."
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_04",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Don't touch the window sill. Pies cooling. Touch the pies and you lose a finger."
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_05",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "annoyed",
                    "text": "The mayor came by again. Ate three buns. Paid for one. Classic."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Do you have the Angler's Hook?",
                    "if": {
                        "quest_step": [
                            "hook",
                            "find"
                        ],
                        "not_flag": "asked_hook:dot"
                    },
                    "goto": "hook"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Let's play memory.",
                    "if": {
                        "any": [
                            {
                                "flag": "asked_hook:dot"
                            },
                            {
                                "quest_done": "hook"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "goto": "play"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        },
        "hook": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "asked_hook:dot"
            },
            "then": [
                {
                    "if": {
                        "seed_choice": {
                            "key": "hook_holder",
                            "options": [
                                "bramble",
                                "dot"
                            ],
                            "is": "dot"
                        }
                    },
                    "goto": "hook_yes"
                },
                "hook_no"
            ]
        },
        "hook_yes": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "dot_06",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "guilty",
                    "text": "The Hook? Oh, THAT Hook. Yeah. I used it to get a tray off the top shelf. Long story."
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_07",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "Look, I'll give it back. But I'm not just handing it over, I've got my pride."
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_08",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Play me a round of memory. If you win, it's yours. If you lose, you buy a bun. Kidding. Mostly."
                }
            ],
            "then": "play"
        },
        "hook_no": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "dot_09",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "annoyed",
                    "text": "The Angler's Hook? Why would I have that, do I look like I fish? I'm a baker. I bake."
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_10",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "...But you look bored. I've got a game. Cards, pairs, the whole thing. Fancy a round?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_11",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Win and I'll pay you a bit. Lose and you've wasted your time. Which, honestly, is the real price."
                }
            ],
            "then": "play"
        },
        "play": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "dot_12",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "Twenty cards, ten pairs, and not much time. Ready?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "dot_13",
                    "who": "dot",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "First game's on me. After that it costs you. And the more you win, the more it costs. Business.",
                    "if": {
                        "not_flag": "explained_price:dot"
                    },
                    "do": {
                        "flag": "explained_price:dot"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Let's go. - {price:memory}",
                    "do": {
                        "minigame": {
                            "type": "memory",
                            "win": "won",
                            "lose": "lost",
                            "poor": "poor"
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "text": "Maybe later.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        },
        "won": {
            "then": [
                {
                    "if": {
                        "seed_choice": {
                            "key": "hook_holder",
                            "options": [
                                "bramble",
                                "dot"
                            ],
                            "is": "dot"
                        },
                        "quest_step": [
                            "hook",
                            "find"
                        ],
                        "not_item": "Hook"
